/*********************************************************************** 
    Castle Dungeon Cardputer

    v 0.60  - Redefine sprites

    v 0.50  - Restructure game/main loop
            - Fixed kill/lost to beast animation
            - Info panel: Items taken, spell on, motion indicators 
            - Player sprite shows direction of motion
            - Modified showSprite() to include transparency
            - Changed spell: off it after 2 steps
        
    v 0.42  Moving to PC (Windows 11)

    *************************************
    TO DO:
    *************************************
    * Countdown timer
    * Victory screen
    *************************************

    Board: M5Cardputer
        (1) File --> Preferences
        (2) Additional Boards Manage URLs: https://m5stack.oss-cn-shenzhen.aliyuncs.com/resource/arduino/package_m5stack_index.json
        (3) OK
        (4) Tools --> Board --> Boards Manager... ==> M5Stack
        (5) Install
    Library:
        (1) Sketch → Include Library → Manage Libraries... ==> M5Cardputer
        (2) Install All
    Settings
        (1) Tools → Board = M5Cardputer
        (2) Tools → Flash size = 8Mb (64MB)
        (3) Tools → Flash Mode = OPI
        (4) Tools → Partition Scheme = 8M with spiffs (3MB APP/1.5MB SPIFFS)
        (5) Tools → PSRAM = OPI PSRAM
        (6) Tools → USB CDC On Boot = Enabled
        
    Screen = 240x135
    Cell/sprite = 45x45 (16*2.8)
    Lighted area = 3*45 x 3*45 = 135x135 pixels

    TOOLS:

    (1) Draw sprites
        https://www.pixel-editor.com

    (2) Convert PNG 8x8 8-bit to C data array
        https://notisrac.github.io/FileToCArray/
        
***********************************************************************/

